                <triso:goal name="Authorize return process is to efficiently and accurately manage the return of products from customers, ensuring that only eligible returns are accepted, while minimizing costs and maintaining high levels of customer satisfaction." triso:readOnly="false" id="_0c736f27-a82a-4902-8c1b-8a11a2160b8b"/>
